{"id":"pensamiento","lemma":"pensamiento","pos":"noun","rank":1695,"glosses":["thought","thinking","pansy (flower)"],"ipa":"/pensaˈmjento/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"pensamientos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/7f/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-pensamiento.wav","examples":[{"text":"Tom es de pensamiento muy independiente.","en":"Tom is very independent-minded.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/297801"},{"text":"Tom estaba sumido en sus pensamientos.","en":"Tom was deep in thought.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/806324"},{"text":"¡Qué pensamiento tan extraño!","en":"What a strange thought!"},{"text":"Tom estaba enfrascado en sus pensamientos.","en":"Tom was deep in thought.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/806325"},{"text":"Ese pensamiento me aterrorizó.","en":"That thought terrified me."}]}